@baseUrl = http://localhost:4011

### search across name, SKU, and slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?q=tee

### search is case-insensitive
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?q=MUG

### ask for only the fields you render
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?fields=name,priceCents&limit=3

### id is always included, even if you do not ask for it
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?fields=name&limit=1

### unknown fields cannot silently disappear
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?fields=name,passwordHash

### a search that matches nothing is still 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?q=zzzz
